CHAPTER VI

COOPERATION AND PARTNERSHIP

Article 16

1. In order to achieve the objectives of implementing PPA as referred to in Article 3, the Regional Government cooperates with: a. the Provincial government;
b. other Regency/City governments;
c. the Police;

15 -
d. the Prosecutor's Office;
e. the Court; and/ orf. non-governmental institutions.
2. The cooperation referred to in paragraph (1), includes:a. exchange of data and information;
b. rehabilitation of victims of violence;
c. repatriation and social reintegration;
d. provision of evidence and witnesses;
e. followed up in accordance with applicable law; and f. Prevention efforts to prevent the occurrence of criminal acts against Women and children.
3. The cooperation referred to in paragraph (1) and paragraph (2) shall be set forth in the form of a joint agreement.

